@startuml
title AromaType Dynamic View - Recommendation Flow

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "Mini App Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Go HTTP API" as API
participant "Questionnaire Service" as Service
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

User -> Frontend : Start selection
Frontend -> API : GET /api/questions
API -> Service : GetQuestions()
Service -> DB : Load active questions and options
DB --> Service : Questions
Service --> API : Questions
API --> Frontend : JSON questions

loop 8 questionnaire steps
  User -> Frontend : Select answer option
end

Frontend -> API : POST /api/recommendations\nanswerOptionIds[]
API -> Service : Recommend(answerOptionIds)
Service -> DB : Load answer option tag weights
Service -> DB : Load tag names
Service -> DB : Load active fragrances and fragrance tags
Service -> Service : Build user psychotype scores
Service -> Service : Score fragrance tag and psychotype matches
Service -> Service : Sort deterministically and limit to 5
Service --> API : Profile + recommendation items
API --> Frontend : JSON recommendation response
Frontend --> User : Profile, product list, product cards

User -> Frontend : Open fragrance card
Frontend -> API : GET /api/fragrances/{id}
API -> Service : GetFragrance(id)
Service -> DB : Load fragrance details
DB --> Service : Fragrance
Service --> API : Fragrance
API --> Frontend : JSON fragrance details
Frontend --> User : Notes, accords, volume options

@enduml
